      "en": "For the bed is too short to stretch out on, and the blanket is too narrow to wrap oneself in.",
      "ko": "침상이 짧아서 능히 몸을 펴지 못하며 이불이 좁아서 능히 몸을 싸지 못함 같으리라 하셨나니",
      "source_text_hash": "cee3461a3d889cd50f46d0cec280d4f0dbd2f67f3063b4651bb66ed12b807f6a",
      "translation_text_hash": "fc54db6dffdb3b1a3b339390185fcf4ad6836071d888063e3c8aff6aa517328f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
