      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ISA",
          "chapter": 28,
          "verse": 25
        }
      ],
      "en": "When he has leveled its surface, doesn’t he plant the dill, and scatter the cumin seed, and put in the wheat in rows, the barley in the appointed place, and the spelt in its place?",
      "ko": "지면을 이미 평평히 하였으면 소회향을 뿌리며 대회향을 뿌리며 소맥을 줄줄이 심으며 대맥을 정한 곳에 심으며 귀리를 그 가에 심지 않겠느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "3f724d2eeda4bcdbfcfa81491de08560ecec0056162728f875aa6e8fb13780ad",
      "translation_text_hash": "06fea9f2c25563851e0e8126802edeaa638890da95e566b882850df997e89c15",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
